<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-029" chapter-id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context" source-id="s-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context-ws1538079">
  <p id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p001:m0000" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_C">績</persName>寡玩好，少嗜欲，居無僕妾，躬事約儉，所有租秩，悉寄天府。及薨後，府有南康國無名錢數千萬。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">子<persName id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002:m0001" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_CA">會理</persName>嗣，字<persName id="c-liangshu-029-huili-xiangzhou-context:p002:m0006" ref="fo7_f8v_rmf_CA">長才</persName>。少聰慧，好文史。年十一而孤，特爲高祖所愛，衣服禮秩與正王不殊。年十五，拜輕車將軍、湘州刺史，又領石頭戍軍事。</p>
</text>
